        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben Queen, Rashida Jones, Will McCormack, Lenora Crichlow, Chuck Bartowski\n- TV series: A to Z, Parks and Recreation, Back in the Game, Chuck\n- Companies/Networks: Warner Bros., NBC, ABC\n\nFacts:\n- Ben Queen created the American romantic comedy television series A to Z.\n- Ben Queen served as an executive producer of A to Z with Rashida Jones and Will McCormack for Warner Bros.\n- Rashida Jones is widely known for playing Ann Perkins on NBC's comedy Parks and Recreation, for which she received acclaim.\n- Lenora Crichlow later had regular roles in the ABC sitcom Back in the Game and the NBC comedy series A to Z.\n- Charles Irving \"Chuck\" Bartowski is the main and title character of the American spy show Chuck on NBC.",
